    continue`, cents bucket, sorted keys, smallest-dayDiff then
    `txns[j].Hash < txns[bestJ].Hash` tiebreak, `Key: pairKey(identityKey(i),
    identityKey(bestJ))`.
  - New shape (read from the diff): isCandidatePair returns the old shape OR
    isSameDayReimportPair, which enforces `dayDiff(a,b) > 1 -> false`,
    `a.OriginalDescription == "" || b.OriginalDescription == "" -> false`, then
